window.BV_CURRICULUM = {"chapters":[{"id":"C1","title":"Welcome. Your job in one line","steps":[{"t":"say","icon":"👋","h":"Meet Maria","text":"Maria sees a home online. She taps **Contact agent**. One minute later, her phone rings. Who is calling? **You.**"},{"t":"say","icon":"📞","h":"Your job in one line","text":"You are an **ISA**: an inside sales agent. You call leads. You set appointments for an agent."},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each card","cards":[{"front":"Lead","back":"A person who asked about a home."},{"front":"Client","back":"The US agent or team you work for."},{"front":"Appointment","back":"A set day and time to meet the agent."},{"front":"ISA","back":"You! You call leads and book appointments."}]},{"t":"pick","q":"What is your main job?","options":["Sell homes","Set appointments for the agent","Give home prices"],"answer":1,"why":"The agent sells homes. You book the agent's appointments."},{"t":"sort","h":"Whose job is it?","left":"My job","right":"Agent's job","items":[{"text":"Call new leads fast","side":"left"},{"text":"Show the home","side":"right"},{"text":"Ask a few easy questions","side":"left"},{"text":"Talk about price","side":"right"},{"text":"Book the appointment","side":"left"},{"text":"Write the offer","side":"right"}]},{"t":"tattoo","text":"You set the appointment. The agent does the rest.","sub":"That is how you both win."},{"t":"say","icon":"🤝","h":"Who is LockedIn VAs?","text":"**LockedIn VAs** is your company. We train you, pay you and help you. Your **coordinator** is your helper there."},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each card","cards":[{"front":"Coordinator","back":"Your LockedIn VAs helper. Tell them problems first."},{"front":"Your client","back":"The agent. They give you the daily work."},{"front":"Client channel","back":"The one chat where you and your client talk."}]},{"t":"chat","who":"Mark","channel":"text","says":"Hey, send me your WhatsApp. It's easier.","options":[{"text":"Sure! Here is my number.","good":false,"why":"No private chats. Your coordinator cannot see them."},{"text":"Thanks, Mark! Let's keep it in our channel.","good":true,"why":"Kind and clear. Everything stays in one place."}]},{"t":"tattoo","text":"All client talk stays in the client channel.","sub":"Your coordinator can see it and help you."},{"t":"pick","q":"Your internet stops working. Who do you tell first?","options":["The lead","Nobody. Wait and see.","Your coordinator"],"answer":2,"why":"Your coordinator helps you. Tell them at once."},{"t":"say","icon":"💵","h":"How you get paid","text":"You are paid **once a month**, in **US dollars**. You are paid for your **tracked hours**. A tool named Hubstaff tracks them."},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"You are paid once a ","after":" in US dollars.","options":["week","month","day"],"answer":1},{"t":"pick","q":"Who pays you?","options":["LockedIn VAs","The lead","The client, in cash"],"answer":0,"why":"LockedIn VAs bills the client and pays you. Simple."},{"t":"pick","q":"Your pay looks wrong. Who do you ask?","options":["Your client","Your coordinator","A lead"],"answer":1,"why":"Never ask the client about pay. Your coordinator checks it."},{"t":"say","icon":"🎮","h":"How this boot camp works","text":"12 short chapters. One day. You tap, flip, sort and speak. Each chapter ends with 5 quick questions."},{"t":"pick","q":"You tap a wrong answer. What happens?","options":["You fail the boot camp","You lose pay","You try again"],"answer":2,"why":"Wrong taps help you learn. No stress."},{"t":"speak","h":"Say it out loud","line":"Hi Maria, this is Sofia with Dana Lee's team.","times":3},{"t":"say","icon":"⭐","h":"What a great ISA does","text":"A great ISA calls **fast** and is kind. A great ISA asks easy questions. Then asks for the appointment. Then writes a note."},{"t":"pick","q":"What does a great ISA do?","options":["Talks a lot about prices","Calls fast and asks for the appointment","Waits for leads to call back"],"answer":1,"why":"Fast, kind, and always asks for a day and time."},{"t":"order","h":"Put Maria's story in order","items":["Maria asks about a home online","You call her fast","You ask a few easy questions","You book a time with the agent","The agent meets Maria"]},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"The agent you work for is your ","after":".","options":["client","lead","coordinator"],"answer":0},{"t":"speak","h":"Say it out loud","line":"I can set a time with the agent. Does today or tomorrow work better?","times":3},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Not sure? Ask your coordinator.","sub":"Asking is smart. Guessing is risky."},{"t":"win","text":"Nice work! You know your job, your team and your pay."}],"quiz":[{"q":"What does an ISA do?","options":["Calls leads and sets appointments","Sells homes","Gives home loans"],"answer":0,"explain":"You call leads and set appointments. The agent sells homes."},{"q":"How often are you paid?","options":["Every week","Every two weeks","Once a month, in US dollars"],"answer":2,"explain":"Pay comes once a month, in US dollars, for tracked hours."},{"q":"Where do you talk with your client?","options":["Private WhatsApp","Only in the client channel","Personal email"],"answer":1,"explain":"The client channel keeps everything in one safe place."},{"q":"What does a great ISA do?","options":["Waits for leads to call","Calls fast and asks for the appointment","Tells leads what a home is worth"],"answer":1,"explain":"Call fast, be kind and ask for a time."},{"q":"Your pay looks wrong. Who do you ask?","options":["Your coordinator","Your client","The lead"],"answer":0,"explain":"Your coordinator checks your hours and your pay."}],"mins":16},{"id":"C2","title":"Your tools and your day","steps":[{"t":"say","icon":"☕","h":"It is 8:55 AM","text":"Your shift starts in five minutes. Your headset is on. What do you open first?"},{"t":"pick","q":"What do you do first?","options":["Call a lead","Clock in on Hubstaff","Check Facebook"],"answer":1,"why":"No clock in, no tracked hours. Tracked hours are your pay."},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each card","cards":[{"front":"Hubstaff","back":"The tool that tracks your work time."},{"front":"Clock in","back":"Start the timer when you start work."},{"front":"Clock out","back":"Stop the timer for breaks and lunch."},{"front":"Screenshot","back":"A picture of your screen, about every two minutes."}]},{"t":"sort","h":"Timer on or off?","left":"Clocked in","right":"Clocked out","items":[{"text":"Calling leads","side":"left"},{"text":"Lunch","side":"right"},{"text":"Writing notes","side":"left"},{"text":"A personal call","side":"right"},{"text":"Writing your daily report","side":"left"}]},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Clock in to work. Clock out for breaks.","sub":"Honest time keeps your pay safe."},{"t":"say","icon":"📸","h":"Your client can see","text":"Hubstaff takes screenshots while you are clocked in. Your client can see them. Keep only work on your screen."},{"t":"sort","h":"OK on your screen at work?","left":"OK","right":"Not OK","items":[{"text":"Follow Up Boss","side":"left"},{"text":"Facebook","side":"right"},{"text":"Your bank","side":"right"},{"text":"The client channel","side":"left"},{"text":"Personal email","side":"right"}]},{"t":"pick","q":"A friend has an app that fakes mouse moves. Do you use it?","options":["Yes, on slow days","Only at lunch","Never"],"answer":2,"why":"That is cheating. Honest hours keep your job safe."},{"t":"say","icon":"🗂️","h":"Where leads live","text":"**Follow Up Boss** is your main tool. Every lead is there. You see the name, the phone and the home they liked."},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each card","cards":[{"front":"Follow Up Boss","back":"The tool where all the leads live."},{"front":"Note","back":"What happened on the call. You write it."},{"front":"Password vault","back":"A safe app that holds and fills your passwords."}]},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"After every call, write a ","after":" in Follow Up Boss.","options":["note","price","password"],"answer":0},{"t":"chat","who":"Mark","channel":"text","says":"I'll send you the login password here in chat.","options":[{"text":"OK, send it here.","good":false,"why":"Chat is not safe for passwords."},{"text":"Thanks! Please add it to the vault instead.","good":true,"why":"Passwords travel only in the vault. You said it kindly."},{"text":"Text it to my phone.","good":false,"why":"Texts are not safe. Use the vault."}]},{"t":"sort","h":"Safe or not safe?","left":"Safe","right":"Not safe","items":[{"text":"Log in with the vault","side":"left"},{"text":"Write a password in a notebook","side":"right"},{"text":"Download the lead list","side":"right"},{"text":"Work inside the client's tools","side":"left"},{"text":"Use café Wi-Fi for work","side":"right"}]},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Passwords live in the vault. Client data stays inside.","sub":"Never download or copy client data."},{"t":"say","icon":"⚡","h":"Power out!","text":"Power or internet can stop. It is not your fault. Tell your **coordinator** at once. Then switch to your backup."},{"t":"order","h":"Outage! Put the steps in order","items":["Tell your coordinator at once","Switch to your backup internet or power","Tell the client channel","Call back any dropped lead"]},{"t":"speak","h":"Say it out loud","line":"Hi Carla, my power is out. I am switching to my backup now.","times":3},{"t":"pick","q":"Why tell your coordinator so fast?","options":["So you can rest","New leads keep coming. Someone must call them.","It is just a nice habit"],"answer":1,"why":"Your coordinator can get help for the new leads."},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Outage? Tell your coordinator at once.","sub":"Fast news lets your team help."},{"t":"say","icon":"📝","h":"The daily report","text":"At the end of every shift, post a short report. Put it in the client channel. Share your calls, appointments and any problems."},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"Post your daily report in the ","after":".","options":["private chat","password vault","client channel"],"answer":2},{"t":"order","h":"Put a normal shift in order","items":["Clock in on Hubstaff","Call new leads first","Follow up and write notes","Post your daily report","Clock out"]},{"t":"pick","q":"What is the last thing before you clock out?","options":["Post your daily report","Delete old leads","Change your password"],"answer":0,"why":"Every shift ends with a daily report. Every time."},{"t":"speak","h":"Say it out loud","line":"Thanks, Mark! Could you add it to the vault instead?","times":2},{"t":"win","text":"You know your tools and your day. Next: real estate words!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"What tracks your work hours?","options":["Follow Up Boss","Hubstaff","The password vault"],"answer":1,"explain":"Hubstaff tracks your time. Tracked hours are your pay."},{"q":"Where do leads live?","options":["Follow Up Boss","Hubstaff","Your notebook"],"answer":0,"explain":"Every lead and every note is in Follow Up Boss."},{"q":"Your internet goes out. What do you do first?","options":["Wait quietly","Go to a café","Tell your coordinator at once"],"answer":2,"explain":"Tell your coordinator first. Then switch to your backup."},{"q":"How should a client share a password with you?","options":["In the chat","In the password vault","By text"],"answer":1,"explain":"Passwords travel only in the vault."},{"q":"What do you post at the end of every shift?","options":["A daily report","A screenshot","A new password"],"answer":0,"explain":"The daily report goes in the client channel, every shift."}],"mins":16},{"id":"C3","title":"Real estate in 15 minutes","steps":[{"t":"say","icon":"🏡","h":"Two people, two dreams","text":"Maria wants to **buy** a home. Tom wants to **sell** his home. Both need help. Let's meet the team."},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each card","cards":[{"front":"Buyer","back":"A person who wants to buy a home."},{"front":"Seller","back":"A person who wants to sell a home."},{"front":"Agent","back":"A licensed person who helps people buy or sell."},{"front":"Lender","back":"A bank or company that lends money for a home."}]},{"t":"pick","q":"Who lends Maria the money?","options":["The seller","The lender","The ISA"],"answer":1,"why":"A lender gives the home loan. Not you, not the agent."},{"t":"say","icon":"📋","h":"Homes for sale","text":"A **listing** is a home for sale. The **MLS** is the agents' big list of homes for sale."},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each card","cards":[{"front":"Listing","back":"A home that is for sale."},{"front":"MLS","back":"The agents' big list of homes for sale."},{"front":"Showing (or tour)","back":"A visit to see a home inside."},{"front":"Offer","back":"The buyer says, in writing: I will pay this price."}]},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"A visit to see a home is a ","after":".","options":["closing","showing","lender"],"answer":1},{"t":"say","icon":"💌","h":"The magic letter","text":"A **pre-approval** is a letter from a lender. It says how much the buyer can borrow. It shows the buyer is ready."},{"t":"pick","q":"Maria has a pre-approval. What does it mean?","options":["A lender said how much she can borrow","She owns the home now","She must buy today"],"answer":0,"why":"It is a lender's letter. It shows she is ready."},{"t":"speak","h":"Say it out loud","line":"Have you talked with a lender about a pre-approval yet?","times":3},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each card","cards":[{"front":"Inspection","back":"An expert checks the home for problems."},{"front":"Escrow","back":"The waiting time between offer and closing."},{"front":"Closing","back":"The last day. Papers are signed. The buyer gets keys."}]},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Offer, then escrow, then closing.","sub":"Every sale follows this order."},{"t":"say","icon":"🛣️","h":"The buyer's road","text":"Every buyer walks the same road. It has five steps. You meet most buyers near the start."},{"t":"order","h":"Put the buyer's road in order","items":["Get a pre-approval from a lender","Tour homes with the agent","Make an offer","Escrow: checks and papers","Closing: get the keys"]},{"t":"pick","q":"Maria says: \"I saw a home online. Can I see it?\" Where is she?","options":["At closing","In escrow","Ready to tour"],"answer":2,"why":"She wants a showing. Time to book the agent!"},{"t":"chat","who":"Maria","channel":"call","says":"I want to see the home on Oak Street.","options":[{"text":"What price will you offer?","good":false,"why":"Too soon. And price talk is the agent's job."},{"text":"Great! The agent can show you. Saturday or Sunday?","good":true,"why":"You offered a tour with two choices. Perfect."}]},{"t":"say","icon":"🔑","h":"The seller's road","text":"Sellers have a road too. It also has five steps. It starts with a meeting with the agent."},{"t":"order","h":"Put the seller's road in order","items":["Meet the agent","List the home for sale","Buyers come to showings","Accept an offer","Escrow and closing"]},{"t":"sort","h":"Buyer or seller?","left":"Buyer says","right":"Seller says","items":[{"text":"I want to see this home.","side":"left"},{"text":"What is my home worth?","side":"right"},{"text":"I need a loan.","side":"left"},{"text":"I want to list my home.","side":"right"},{"text":"We got an offer on our home.","side":"right"}]},{"t":"chat","who":"Tom","channel":"call","says":"So, what is my home worth?","options":[{"text":"Great question for your agent. Can they call you today?","good":true,"why":"Only the agent talks about value. You book the time."},{"text":"About $400,000, I think.","good":false,"why":"Never guess a price. That is the agent's job."},{"text":"I don't know. Bye!","good":false,"why":"Do not end the call. Offer a time with the agent."}]},{"t":"tattoo","text":"You book the meeting. The agent gives the advice.","sub":"Price, loans and contracts are not your job."},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"The day the buyer gets the keys is the ","after":".","options":["closing","listing","showing"],"answer":0},{"t":"pick","q":"Who goes to the showing with the buyer?","options":["You","The lender","The agent"],"answer":2,"why":"You book it. The agent opens the door."},{"t":"speak","h":"Say it out loud","line":"Would you like to see the home this week?","times":3},{"t":"pick","q":"What is the MLS?","options":["A kind of loan","The agents' list of homes for sale","A closing paper"],"answer":1,"why":"Agents put homes for sale on the MLS."},{"t":"win","text":"You speak real estate now! Buyer road, seller road, done."}],"quiz":[{"q":"What is a pre-approval?","options":["A lender's letter saying how much a buyer can borrow","A home for sale","The last day of a sale"],"answer":0,"explain":"A lender writes it. It shows the buyer is ready."},{"q":"What is a listing?","options":["A loan","A home tour","A home for sale"],"answer":2,"explain":"A listing is a home that is for sale."},{"q":"What comes right after the offer is accepted?","options":["A showing","Escrow","A pre-approval"],"answer":1,"explain":"Offer, then escrow, then closing."},{"q":"What happens at closing?","options":["The buyer tours the home","The agent lists the home","Papers are signed and the buyer gets keys"],"answer":2,"explain":"Closing is the last day. The buyer gets the keys."},{"q":"A seller asks what the home is worth. What do you do?","options":["Guess a price","Book a time with the agent","Send them to a lender"],"answer":1,"explain":"Only the agent talks about value. You book the meeting."}],"mins":16},{"id":"C4","title":"What you can say. What you cannot","steps":[{"t":"say","icon":"🤔","h":"A hard question","text":"Maria asks, \"Is this house worth the price?\" You do not know. Good news: you do not have to answer."},{"t":"say","icon":"✅","h":"Your 3 jobs","text":"You ask friendly questions. You do A.L.M. You set appointments. That is your whole job on the phone."},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each card","cards":[{"front":"Discovery","back":"Friendly questions to learn what the lead wants."},{"front":"A.L.M.","back":"Appointment, Location, Motivation. You learn it soon."},{"front":"Appointment","back":"A set day and time with the agent."}]},{"t":"say","icon":"🪪","h":"The agent has a license","text":"A license is a permit from the state. Your agent has one. You do not. So some topics are only for the agent."},{"t":"flip","h":"Things you never do","cards":[{"front":"Price","back":"Never say what a home is worth."},{"front":"Law and loans","back":"Never give legal or loan advice."},{"front":"Inspection","back":"A home checkup. Never explain the report."},{"front":"Deals and pay","back":"Never negotiate. Never talk about commission, the agent's pay."}]},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Hard question? Send it to your agent.","sub":"The agent has the license. You set the meeting."},{"t":"speak","h":"Say it out loud","line":"Great question for your agent. Let's set a time to talk with them.","times":3},{"t":"sort","h":"Can you say it?","left":"OK to say","right":"Not OK","items":[{"text":"What area do you like?","side":"left"},{"text":"This home costs too much.","side":"right"},{"text":"Would Saturday at 11 work?","side":"left"},{"text":"You should offer less.","side":"right"},{"text":"The agent can answer that.","side":"left"},{"text":"That contract line means...","side":"right"}]},{"t":"chat","who":"Maria","channel":"call","says":"Is this house worth the price?","options":[{"text":"Yes, it is a great price.","good":false,"why":"That is a price opinion. Only the agent gives one."},{"text":"Great question for your agent. Would Saturday at 11 or 2 work?","good":true,"why":"You sent it to the agent. You asked for a time."},{"text":"I think it is a bit high.","good":false,"why":"Never say what a home is worth."}]},{"t":"chat","who":"Tom","channel":"call","says":"The inspection found a roof problem. Is that bad?","options":[{"text":"Great question for your agent. I will tell them today.","good":true,"why":"You did not guess. The agent will help."},{"text":"Roofs are easy to fix. Don't worry.","good":false,"why":"You explained an inspection. That is not your job."}]},{"t":"pick","q":"A lead asks, \"Will the seller take less?\" What do you do?","options":["Say \"Yes, probably\"","Call the seller yourself","Send the question to your agent"],"answer":2,"why":"That is negotiating. Only the agent negotiates."},{"t":"pick","q":"A lead asks, \"Are you the agent?\" What do you say?","options":["Yes, I am.","No, I am on the agent's team.","I can't tell you."],"answer":1,"why":"Always tell the truth. Never say you are the agent."},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"Great question for your ","after":". Let's set a time.","options":["cousin","bank","agent"],"answer":2},{"t":"order","h":"A hard question comes. Put your steps in order","items":["Say, \"Great question for your agent.\"","Ask for a day and time","Write the question in your note"]},{"t":"say","icon":"⚖️","h":"Fair housing","text":"Fair housing is a US law. Every person gets the same help. So you treat every lead the same."},{"t":"say","icon":"🏘️","h":"Never describe an area","text":"Never describe an area by its people, schools, crime or safety. Even a nice word can break the rule."},{"t":"chat","who":"Ana","channel":"call","says":"Is this a safe neighborhood?","options":[{"text":"Yes, very safe. Good families live there.","good":false,"why":"You described the area by safety and people."},{"text":"No, I would not live there.","good":false,"why":"That is your opinion about an area. Never give one."},{"text":"Great question for your agent. I can also send you public sources.","good":true,"why":"You stayed fair. You still helped."}]},{"t":"sort","h":"Fair or not?","left":"OK to say","right":"Not OK","items":[{"text":"How many bedrooms do you need?","side":"left"},{"text":"The schools there are the best.","side":"right"},{"text":"Do you want a yard?","side":"left"},{"text":"Lots of young families live there.","side":"right"},{"text":"It is a quiet, safe street.","side":"right"}]},{"t":"pick","q":"What do you write in your notes?","options":["What the lead wants in the home","Where the lead is from","The lead's religion"],"answer":0,"why":"Write what they want in the home. Not who they are."},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Talk about the home. Never about the people.","sub":"This keeps every lead treated the same."},{"t":"speak","h":"Say it out loud","line":"Great question for your agent. I can also send you public sources.","times":2},{"t":"say","icon":"🔒","h":"Client data stays private","text":"Lead names, phones and emails belong to your client. They stay inside the client's tools. Never copy, download or share them."},{"t":"sort","h":"Safe or not safe?","left":"Safe","right":"Not safe","items":[{"text":"Work inside Follow Up Boss","side":"left"},{"text":"Send a lead list to my email","side":"right"},{"text":"Use the password vault","side":"left"},{"text":"Take a photo of my screen","side":"right"},{"text":"Share a login in a chat","side":"right"}]},{"t":"pick","q":"You think you shared client data by mistake. What do you do?","options":["Wait and see","Tell your coordinator at once","Fix it and tell no one"],"answer":1,"why":"Fast and honest is always best. Your coordinator will help."},{"t":"win","text":"Nice work! You know what to say and what to send to your agent."}],"quiz":[{"q":"A lead asks what a home is worth. What do you say?","options":["It is worth the price.","Great question for your agent.","Offer a little less."],"answer":1,"explain":"Never give a price opinion. Send it to your agent."},{"q":"Which one is your job?","options":["Set appointments","Negotiate the price","Explain the contract"],"answer":0,"explain":"You ask questions, do A.L.M. and set appointments."},{"q":"A lead asks, \"Is the area safe?\" What do you do?","options":["Say it is very safe","Talk about the neighbors","Send it to your agent and offer public sources"],"answer":2,"explain":"Never describe an area by safety or people."},{"q":"What goes in your notes?","options":["What the lead wants in the home","The lead's religion","Where the lead was born"],"answer":0,"explain":"Write about the home they want. Not who they are."},{"q":"Where does client data stay?","options":["In my email","In the client's tools","On my phone"],"answer":1,"explain":"Never copy, download or share client data."}],"mins":16},{"id":"C5","title":"Calling rules that protect you","steps":[{"t":"say","icon":"⏰","h":"Do you call?","text":"A new lead comes in. It is 7 AM for the lead. Do you call now? No. Here is why."},{"t":"say","icon":"🕘","h":"The calling window","text":"You may call leads only at set hours. We call this the calling window. These rules protect you and your client."},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each card","cards":[{"front":"Monday to Saturday","back":"9 AM to 8 PM, the lead's time."},{"front":"Sunday","back":"Noon to 8 PM, the lead's time."},{"front":"Texts","back":"Same hours as calls."},{"front":"Some states","back":"Shorter hours. Your coordinator tells you before you dial."}]},{"t":"tattoo","text":"The lead's clock counts. Not your clock.","sub":"The lead may live in a different time zone."},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"On Sunday, you can call from ","after":" to 8 PM.","options":["9 AM","noon","6 AM"],"answer":1},{"t":"sort","h":"Call now or wait?","left":"Call now","right":"Wait","items":[{"text":"Tuesday, 9:30 AM lead's time","side":"left"},{"text":"Monday, 8:15 AM lead's time","side":"right"},{"text":"Sunday, 10 AM lead's time","side":"right"},{"text":"Saturday, 7:45 PM lead's time","side":"left"},{"text":"Friday, 8:30 PM lead's time","side":"right"},{"text":"Sunday, 1 PM lead's time","side":"left"}]},{"t":"pick","q":"It is 8:30 PM for the lead. Can you send a text?","options":["Yes, texts are always fine","Yes, if it is short","No. Texts follow the same hours."],"answer":2,"why":"Texts follow the calling window too."},{"t":"pick","q":"A lead comes in at 7 AM their time. What do you do?","options":["Call at 9 AM their time","Call right now","Call tomorrow night"],"answer":0,"why":"Wait for the window. Then call first."},{"t":"say","icon":"🛑","h":"DNC means Do Not Call","text":"A lead says \"STOP\", \"remove me\" or \"don't call\". That lead is now DNC. You stop right away."},{"t":"chat","who":"Rick","channel":"call","says":"STOP CALLING ME!","options":[{"text":"Sorry! Just one quick question first?","good":false,"why":"Stop means stop. Never ask again."},{"text":"Why? I only want to help you.","good":false,"why":"Never argue with a lead who says stop."},{"text":"I'm sorry about that. I will remove you right now.","good":true,"why":"Kind, short and done. Now tag the lead DNC."}]},{"t":"order","h":"A lead says STOP. Put your steps in order","items":["Say sorry and goodbye","Tag the lead DNC","Set the stage to Archived / DNC","Pause all automatic messages","Write it in your note"]},{"t":"pick","q":"Can you delete a DNC lead?","options":["Yes, to keep the list clean","No. Keep the lead and the DNC tag.","Yes, after one week"],"answer":1,"why":"The tag tells the whole team never to call again."},{"t":"tattoo","text":"STOP means stop. Tag DNC. Never argue. Never delete.","sub":"This protects you and your client."},{"t":"speak","h":"Say it out loud","line":"I'm sorry about that. I will remove you right now. Have a good day.","times":2},{"t":"say","icon":"📥","h":"Two kinds of leads","text":"An inbound lead asked for a call. You may call them inside the window. Other lists have one more rule."},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each card","cards":[{"front":"Inbound lead","back":"They asked to be contacted. OK to call in the window."},{"front":"Old or bought list","back":"Call only after it is scrubbed."},{"front":"Scrubbed","back":"Checked against the Do Not Call lists."},{"front":"Not sure?","back":"Ask your coordinator before you dial."}]},{"t":"pick","q":"Your client sends an old list of 200 names. What is first?","options":["Start calling fast","Ask if the list was scrubbed","Text all of them"],"answer":1,"why":"Old lists must be scrubbed before any call."},{"t":"say","icon":"💬","h":"Text only with a yes","text":"Text only leads who agreed to get texts. No yes, no text."},{"t":"pick","q":"A lead never agreed to texts. They did not answer. What now?","options":["Send one short text","Text from my own phone","Do not text. Call again later."],"answer":2,"why":"No yes, no text. Call again inside the window."},{"t":"say","icon":"☝️","h":"Dial by hand","text":"You dial each number yourself. No robot dialers. No recorded sales messages."},{"t":"sort","h":"OK or not OK?","left":"OK","right":"Not OK","items":[{"text":"Dial one number by hand","side":"left"},{"text":"Use a robot dialer","side":"right"},{"text":"Play a recorded sales message","side":"right"},{"text":"Leave a voicemail in my own voice","side":"left"},{"text":"Text a lead who said STOP","side":"right"}]},{"t":"say","icon":"🎙️","h":"Say it is recorded","text":"On every call, say the call may be recorded. Say it at the start."},{"t":"speak","h":"Say it out loud","line":"Hi Maria, this is Sofia with Dana Lee's team. This call may be recorded.","times":3},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"This call may be ","after":".","options":["recorded","long","free"],"answer":0},{"t":"chat","who":"Ben","channel":"text","says":"Remove me from your list.","options":[{"text":"Done. I am removing you now. Take care.","good":true,"why":"\"Remove me\" means DNC. You stopped right away."},{"text":"OK. Can I text you next month?","good":false,"why":"Never ask again after a lead says stop."}]},{"t":"win","text":"Great job! You know when to call, when to stop and what to say."}],"quiz":[{"q":"A lead says \"STOP CALLING ME.\" What do you do?","options":["Ask why","Delete the lead","Say sorry, stop and tag DNC"],"answer":2,"explain":"Stop means stop. Never argue. Never delete."},{"q":"When can you call on Sunday?","options":["Noon to 8 PM, lead's time","9 AM to 8 PM, lead's time","Any time"],"answer":0,"explain":"Sunday starts at noon. Texts follow the same hours."},{"q":"Whose clock counts?","options":["My clock","The lead's clock","My client's clock"],"answer":1,"explain":"The window uses the lead's local time."},{"q":"Who can you text?","options":["Any lead","Leads who did not answer","Leads who agreed to texts"],"answer":2,"explain":"No yes, no text."},{"q":"What do you say on every call?","options":["This call may be recorded.","This call is free.","This is a sales call."],"answer":0,"explain":"Always say the call may be recorded."}],"mins":16},{"id":"C6","title":"Zillow and Realtor.com leads","steps":[{"t":"say","icon":"🛋️","h":"Meet Maria","text":"Maria is on her couch. She sees a pretty house on Zillow. She taps a button. Now you get a new lead."},{"t":"say","icon":"🌐","h":"Two big home sites","text":"Zillow and Realtor.com are big home search sites. People look at homes for sale there. Most of your leads come from them."},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each card","cards":[{"front":"Contact agent","back":"A button. The lead wants to ask about a home."},{"front":"Request a tour","back":"A button. The lead wants to see the home."},{"front":"Lead","back":"A person who asked about a home."},{"front":"Tour","back":"A visit to see the home inside."}]},{"t":"pick","q":"What did your lead just do?","options":["Bought a home","Tapped a button on a home they like","Signed papers with an agent"],"answer":1,"why":"They asked about one home. They did not buy yet."},{"t":"say","icon":"🥇","h":"They expect a fast call","text":"They just asked for help. They may have asked other agents too. The first kind, helpful caller usually wins."},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Be first. Be kind. Be helpful.","sub":"The first helpful call usually wins the lead."},{"t":"pick","q":"Why do you call fast?","options":["The lead may have asked other agents too","Fast calls are shorter","My shift ends soon"],"answer":0,"why":"The first helpful call usually wins."},{"t":"say","icon":"📍","h":"Say the address","text":"Open with the address of the home they looked at. Now they know why you are calling."},{"t":"speak","h":"Say it out loud","line":"Hi Maria, this is Sofia with Dana Lee's team. This call may be recorded. You asked about 12 Oak Street, right?","times":3},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"You asked about ","after":" on Zillow, right?","options":["a home","something","12 Oak Street"],"answer":2},{"t":"chat","who":"Maria","channel":"call","says":"Hello? Who is this?","options":[{"text":"Hi Maria! Do you want to buy a home?","good":false,"why":"Too sudden. She does not know why you called."},{"text":"Hi Maria, it's Sofia with Dana Lee's team. You asked about 12 Oak Street?","good":true,"why":"The address tells her why you called."},{"text":"Hi, I am calling from a real estate company.","good":false,"why":"Not clear. Say the home's address."}]},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Always say the home's address.","sub":"It tells the lead why you are calling."},{"t":"say","icon":"🏡","h":"That home first","text":"Ask about that home first. \"What did you like about it?\" Then do A.L.M. That means Appointment, Location, Motivation."},{"t":"order","h":"Put the call in order","items":["Say your name and your team","Say the call may be recorded","Say the home's address","Ask about that home","Do A.L.M. and offer a tour time"]},{"t":"flip","h":"3 kinds of leads","cards":[{"front":"Tour request","back":"They want to see the home. Offer a time now."},{"front":"Question","back":"They want to know one thing. Help, then offer a tour."},{"front":"Just looking","back":"They are early. Be kind and follow up."}]},{"t":"chat","who":"Maria","channel":"call","says":"Yes, I want to see that house.","options":[{"text":"OK, I will email you some info.","good":false,"why":"She asked for a tour. Offer a time now."},{"text":"Great! The agent will call you some day.","good":false,"why":"\"Some day\" is not a plan. Offer two times."},{"text":"Great! Would Saturday at 11 or 2 work better?","good":true,"why":"Two choices make it easy to say yes."}]},{"t":"speak","h":"Say it out loud","line":"Would Saturday at 11 or 2 work better to see the home?","times":3},{"t":"chat","who":"Tom","channel":"call","says":"Does that house have a garage?","options":[{"text":"Good question. I will ask the agent. Want to see it Saturday?","good":true,"why":"You helped. Then you offered a tour."},{"text":"I'm not sure. I think so.","good":false,"why":"Never guess. Ask the agent."},{"text":"Sorry, I can't answer questions.","good":false,"why":"You can still help. Ask the agent for them."}]},{"t":"chat","who":"Ana","channel":"call","says":"I'm just looking right now.","options":[{"text":"OK, sorry to bother you. Bye.","good":false,"why":"You gave up too fast. Many buyers start this way."},{"text":"No problem! Many people start that way. What did you like about that home?","good":true,"why":"Kind and calm. You kept the talk going."},{"text":"You should buy now. Prices will go up.","good":false,"why":"Never push. Never talk about prices."}]},{"t":"say","icon":"🌱","h":"Early is normal","text":"Many leads are early. They are just looking. That is OK. Be kind. Follow up later."},{"t":"pick","q":"A lead says, \"Maybe I will buy next year.\" What do you do?","options":["Delete the lead","Call every day","Be kind, take notes and follow up"],"answer":2,"why":"Early leads can buy later. Stay friendly."},{"t":"pick","q":"Where do you write about each call?","options":["Follow Up Boss","A paper notebook","My own phone"],"answer":0,"why":"Every call gets a note in Follow Up Boss. Your leads live there."},{"t":"sort","h":"Do this or not?","left":"Do this","right":"Not this","items":[{"text":"Call fast","side":"left"},{"text":"Wait until tomorrow","side":"right"},{"text":"Say the home's address","side":"left"},{"text":"Push an early looker","side":"right"},{"text":"Offer a tour time","side":"left"},{"text":"Skip the note","side":"right"}]},{"t":"win","text":"You did it! You can open a Zillow or Realtor.com call the right way."}],"quiz":[{"q":"What did a Zillow or Realtor.com lead just do?","options":["Tapped a button about a home","Bought a home","Met your agent"],"answer":0,"explain":"They tapped \"Contact agent\" or \"Request a tour\"."},{"q":"How do you show the lead why you called?","options":["Talk about loan rates","Say the home's address","Say your company name twice"],"answer":1,"explain":"The address tells the lead why you called."},{"q":"Why call fast?","options":["Fast calls are shorter","My shift ends soon","The first helpful call usually wins"],"answer":2,"explain":"The lead may have asked other agents too."},{"q":"A lead wants a tour. What do you do?","options":["Send an email","Offer two times","Ask them to call back"],"answer":1,"explain":"Ask, \"Would Saturday at 11 or 2 work better?\""},{"q":"A lead is just looking. What do you do?","options":["Be kind and follow up","Delete the lead","Push them to buy now"],"answer":0,"explain":"Early lookers are normal. Many buy later."}],"mins":15},{"id":"C7","title":"Speed to lead and the 3 strikes","steps":[{"t":"say","icon":"📱","h":"Maria taps a button","text":"Maria sees a home online. She taps \"Contact agent\". Her phone is still in her hand. How fast should you call?"},{"t":"pick","q":"How fast do you call a new lead?","options":["In 30 minutes","In 180 seconds","The same day"],"answer":1,"why":"180 seconds is 3 minutes. She is still thinking about the home."},{"t":"tattoo","text":"New lead? Call in 180 seconds.","sub":"The first helpful call usually wins."},{"t":"say","icon":"🏆","h":"Fast is 21 times better","text":"A call in 5 minutes beats a call in 30 minutes. Your chance is about **21 times better**."},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"A call in 5 minutes is about ","after":" times better.","options":["2","21","5"],"answer":1},{"t":"flip","h":"Why does speed win? Tap each card","cards":[{"front":"Did she ask other agents?","back":"Maybe. The first helpful call usually wins."},{"front":"You are writing a note. A lead comes in.","back":"Stop and dial. Only finish a live call first."}]},{"t":"say","icon":"🕘","h":"Stay inside the calling window","text":"Call **9 AM to 8 PM**, Monday to Saturday. On Sunday, **noon to 8 PM**. Use the **lead's** time, not yours. Texts follow the same window."},{"t":"sort","h":"This is the lead's time. Call now?","left":"Call now","right":"Wait","items":[{"text":"Tuesday 10:12 AM","side":"left"},{"text":"Tuesday 8:15 AM","side":"right"},{"text":"Saturday 7:50 PM","side":"left"},{"text":"Sunday 10:05 AM","side":"right"},{"text":"Wednesday 9:45 PM","side":"right"},{"text":"Sunday 1:00 PM","side":"left"}]},{"t":"pick","q":"A lead comes in at 10:40 PM their time. What do you do?","options":["Call at 9 AM tomorrow, before any other call","Send a text now. It is only a text.","Call now, but keep it short"],"answer":0,"why":"No calls or texts after 8 PM. Call first when the window opens."},{"t":"tattoo","text":"The calling window always beats speed.","sub":"Follow the rules first. Then be fast."},{"t":"say","icon":"📵","h":"No answer? That is normal","text":"Most leads do not answer the first call. They are at work or driving. So you use **3 strikes**. A strike is one try."},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each strike","cards":[{"front":"Strike 1","back":"Call now. Let it ring 5 to 6 times. Leave a 20-second voicemail."},{"front":"Strike 2","back":"Text at 2 minutes. Only if they agreed to texts."},{"front":"Strike 3","back":"Call again about 4 hours later, before 6 PM their time."}]},{"t":"order","h":"Put the 3 strikes in order","items":["Call and leave a short voicemail","Text 2 minutes later","Call again about 4 hours later"]},{"t":"speak","h":"Say your voicemail out loud","line":"Hi Maria, this is Ana with Rivera Home Team. You asked about 12 Oak Street. I will try you again soon.","times":3},{"t":"pick","q":"Which Strike 2 text is best?","options":["Hi! Are you still looking?","PLEASE CALL ME BACK TODAY!!","Hi Maria, it's Ana with Rivera Home Team. I called about 12 Oak Street. Want to see it Thursday at 5 or Saturday at 11?"],"answer":2,"why":"It says her name, the home, and two times."},{"t":"pick","q":"Maria did not agree to texts. What is Strike 2?","options":["Skip the text. Set the Strike 3 call.","Text her one time only","Call her again in 2 minutes"],"answer":0,"why":"Text only leads who agreed to texts."},{"t":"pick","q":"A lead comes in Tuesday at 6:30 PM. No answer. When is Strike 3?","options":["Tonight at 10:30 PM","Wednesday at 9 AM their time","Next Monday"],"answer":1,"why":"Four hours later is too late. Call first when the window opens."},{"t":"say","icon":"✅","h":"They answered? Strikes stop","text":"If the lead answers or texts back, the strikes stop. Now you talk and offer a time. **Log every try** in Follow Up Boss."},{"t":"chat","who":"Maria","channel":"text","says":"Hi! Is 12 Oak Street still for sale?","options":[{"text":"Yes! And the price can go lower.","good":false,"why":"Never guess. Never talk about price."},{"text":"I will ask Daniel, our agent, now. Want to see it Thursday at 5 or Saturday at 11?","good":true,"why":"Honest, fast, and it offers two times."},{"text":"I will get back to you next week.","good":false,"why":"Too slow. She will find another agent."}]},{"t":"pick","q":"What is your goal in the first 3 minutes?","options":["Read every old note first","Wait to see if the lead calls you","Call fast, learn what they want, and set an appointment"],"answer":2,"why":"Call fast. Learn what they want. Book a time with the agent."},{"t":"pick","q":"Three strikes and still no answer. Is the lead lost?","options":["Yes. Delete the lead.","No. Log all 3 tries. Follow-up keeps going.","Yes. Tag the lead DNC."],"answer":1,"why":"Many leads answer later. Never delete a lead for no answer."},{"t":"tattoo","text":"No answer? Text at 2 minutes.","sub":"Many people read texts but skip calls."},{"t":"win","text":"You did it! You can now call fast and run the 3 strikes."}],"quiz":[{"q":"A new lead comes in at 2 PM their time. When do you call?","options":["Within 180 seconds","Within 30 minutes","At the end of your shift"],"answer":0,"explain":"Call in 180 seconds, inside the calling window."},{"q":"A call in 5 minutes, not 30, makes your chance about:","options":["2 times better","21 times better","The same"],"answer":1,"explain":"Fast calls are about 21 times better."},{"q":"The lead does not answer your first call. What is next?","options":["Wait three days, then call","Mark the lead as lost","Leave a voicemail, then text at 2 minutes"],"answer":2,"explain":"Strike 2 is a text, if they agreed to texts."},{"q":"A lead comes in at 9:30 PM their time. What do you do?","options":["Call right away","Call first when the window opens","Text now and call tomorrow"],"answer":1,"explain":"No calls or texts after 8 PM their time."},{"q":"What is your goal in the first 3 minutes?","options":["Call fast, learn what they want, set an appointment","Send a long email","Wait for the lead to call"],"answer":0,"explain":"Speed, then questions, then an appointment."}],"mins":15},{"id":"C8","title":"A.L.M. and the two-minute call","steps":[{"t":"say","icon":"🎉","h":"She picked up!","text":"Maria answers the phone. You have about 20 seconds. Then she decides to stay or go. Good news: you only need **3 letters**."},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each letter","cards":[{"front":"A","back":"Appointment. A day and time with the agent."},{"front":"L","back":"Location. The area and the home they want."},{"front":"M","back":"Motivation. Why they want to move, and when."}]},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"A.L.M. means Appointment, Location and ","after":".","options":["Money","Mortgage","Motivation"],"answer":2},{"t":"tattoo","text":"A.L.M. = Appointment, Location, Motivation.","sub":"Get these three on every call."},{"t":"say","icon":"👋","h":"Your opening line has 4 parts","text":"Say **who you are**. Say the call **may be recorded**. Say the **home** they asked about. Then ask for **two minutes**."},{"t":"order","h":"Put the opening in order","items":["Hi Maria, this is Ana with Rivera Home Team.","This call may be recorded.","You asked about 12 Oak Street.","Do you have two minutes?"]},{"t":"speak","h":"Say your opening out loud","line":"Hi Maria, this is Ana with Rivera Home Team. This call may be recorded. You asked about 12 Oak Street.","times":3},{"t":"flip","h":"4 easy questions. Tap each one","cards":[{"front":"What did you like about that home?","back":"L. What the home needs."},{"front":"Which areas do you like?","back":"L. Where they want to live."},{"front":"Why are you thinking about moving?","back":"M. The reason."},{"front":"When would you like to move?","back":"M. The date."}]},{"t":"sort","h":"Is it L or M?","left":"L: Location","right":"M: Motivation","items":[{"text":"Close to my job","side":"left"},{"text":"We must move by March","side":"right"},{"text":"3 bedrooms and a big yard","side":"left"},{"text":"We need more space","side":"right"},{"text":"Under $500,000","side":"left"}]},{"t":"pick","q":"Which question gets a longer answer?","options":["Do you like the home?","Are you moving soon?","What did you like about the home?"],"answer":2,"why":"\"What\" questions get stories. Yes or no questions do not."},{"t":"chat","who":"Maria","channel":"call","says":"We just need more space.","options":[{"text":"OK. What is your price, your area and your date?","good":false,"why":"Three questions at once is too much. Ask one."},{"text":"Tell me more. What does more space look like?","good":true,"why":"One easy question. Now she tells you the real need."},{"text":"Then buy now. Prices will go up.","good":false,"why":"Never push. Never guess about prices."}]},{"t":"say","icon":"📅","h":"Always ask for the appointment","text":"Ask on **every** call. Give **two choices**: a day and a time. Two choices are easy. She just picks one."},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"Would Saturday at 11 or ","after":" work better?","options":["Sunday at 2","some day","whenever"],"answer":0},{"t":"pick","q":"Which ask is best?","options":["Daniel can show it Thursday at 5 or Saturday at 11. Which is better?","When are you free?","Let me know if you want to see it."],"answer":0,"why":"Two real times are easy to answer."},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Always offer two times. Never ask \"When works?\"","sub":"Two choices make yes easy."},{"t":"speak","h":"Say the ask out loud","line":"Daniel can show it Thursday at 5 or Saturday at 11. Which is better?","times":3},{"t":"say","icon":"⏱️","h":"Ask early","text":"She asked about one home. So ask for the tour in the **first minute**. A tour is a visit to the home. Then ask about L and M."},{"t":"order","h":"Put the two-minute call in order","items":["Say your opening line","Ask easy questions about the home","Offer two times","Repeat the day, time and place"]},{"t":"chat","who":"Maria","channel":"call","says":"Is it still for sale?","options":[{"text":"I will check with Daniel, our agent, right now. Want to see it tomorrow at 4 or 6?","good":true,"why":"Honest. And you asked for the appointment."},{"text":"Yes, for sure. It is a great price too.","good":false,"why":"Never guess. Never give a price opinion."}]},{"t":"chat","who":"Maria","channel":"call","says":"Saturday at 11 works.","options":[{"text":"OK, great. Bye!","good":false,"why":"Repeat the details first. Then she will not forget."},{"text":"Great! I think the seller will take less.","good":false,"why":"Never talk about price. That is the agent's job."},{"text":"Great! Saturday at 11 at 12 Oak Street with Daniel. Is this your best number?","good":true,"why":"You repeat day, time and place. Now it is a real plan."}]},{"t":"pick","q":"You had a nice 8-minute call. No day, no time. What went wrong?","options":["You talked too fast","You never asked for the appointment","The call was too short"],"answer":1,"why":"A nice call with no appointment is only a chat."},{"t":"say","icon":"😊","h":"What a great call sounds like","text":"You **smile**. People can hear it. You speak **slowly**. The lead talks **more than you**."},{"t":"pick","q":"Maria says, \"Sorry? What?\" What do you do?","options":["Say it again, louder","Say sorry and hang up","Say it again, slower, with easy words"],"answer":2,"why":"Slow and clear wins. Your accent is not a problem."},{"t":"tattoo","text":"The lead talks more than you.","sub":"You ask. You listen. Then you book."},{"t":"win","text":"Great work! You can now run a two-minute A.L.M. call."}],"quiz":[{"q":"What does A.L.M. stand for?","options":["Agent, Listing, Mortgage","Appointment, Location, Motivation","Ask, Listen, Move"],"answer":1,"explain":"Appointment, Location, Motivation. Get all three on every call."},{"q":"Which line is in every opening?","options":["This call may be recorded.","I am the agent.","How much money do you make?"],"answer":0,"explain":"Always say the call may be recorded."},{"q":"How do you ask for the appointment?","options":["Ask \"When are you free?\"","Wait for the lead to ask","Offer two choices of day and time"],"answer":2,"explain":"Two choices make it easy to say yes."},{"q":"\"We must move by March.\" Which letter is this?","options":["A","M","L"],"answer":1,"explain":"M is Motivation: why they move, and when."},{"q":"A lead asks about one home. When do you ask for the tour?","options":["Early, in the first minute","At the end of a long call","On the second call"],"answer":0,"explain":"Ask early. Then ask about L and M."}],"mins":16},{"id":"C9","title":"Objections made easy","steps":[{"t":"say","icon":"🚧","h":"\"I'm just looking\"","text":"Maria says, \"I'm just looking.\" Is the call over? No! This is an **objection**. An objection is a reason to say \"not now\"."},{"t":"say","icon":"🧘","h":"Stay calm","text":"Most objections mean \"Please do not push me.\" So smile, slow down, and use **3 steps**."},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each step","cards":[{"front":"1. Acknowledge","back":"Show you heard them. \"Totally fine!\""},{"front":"2. Ask","back":"Ask one easy question about the home or the timing."},{"front":"3. Appointment","back":"Offer two times with the agent."}]},{"t":"order","h":"Put the 3 steps in order","items":["Acknowledge","Ask","Appointment"]},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Acknowledge. Ask. Appointment.","sub":"Three steps fix almost every objection."},{"t":"chat","who":"Maria","channel":"call","says":"We're just looking.","options":[{"text":"OK. Sorry to bother you. Bye!","good":false,"why":"Do not give up so fast. Most leads start this way."},{"text":"This home will sell fast. Decide today.","good":false,"why":"That is pushing. Pushing ends calls."},{"text":"Totally fine! Most people look early. Which area do you like most?","good":true,"why":"You acknowledge. Then you ask an easy question."}]},{"t":"speak","h":"Say it out loud","line":"Totally fine! Most people look early. Which area do you like most?","times":3},{"t":"chat","who":"Maria","channel":"call","says":"I already have an agent.","options":[{"text":"Understood. Did you sign an agreement with them?","good":true,"why":"This one question tells you what to do next."},{"text":"Our agent is better. Give us a try.","good":false,"why":"Never say bad things about another agent."},{"text":"Oh. OK, goodbye.","good":false,"why":"Ask about a signed agreement first."}]},{"t":"pick","q":"She says, \"Yes, we signed.\" What now?","options":["Offer a second opinion anyway","Say \"Great, I'll make a note.\" Then tell your agent.","Call her again next week"],"answer":1,"why":"A signed agreement is a promise. Respect it."},{"t":"pick","q":"She says, \"No, nothing signed.\" What now?","options":["Say goodbye and end the call","Tell her to drop the other agent","Offer a short call with your agent. Give two times."],"answer":2,"why":"With no agreement, she can still talk to your agent."},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Signed with an agent? Respect it. Tell your agent.","sub":"It is fair. It protects your client."},{"t":"chat","who":"Maria","channel":"call","says":"Just send me info.","options":[{"text":"Sure. I will email it. Bye!","good":false,"why":"You sent info but have no next step."},{"text":"I will send it right now! Are you free Saturday morning or afternoon to see it?","good":true,"why":"Say yes. Then ask for the appointment."}]},{"t":"chat","who":"Maria","channel":"call","says":"I'm busy. Call me later.","options":[{"text":"This takes one minute. Please listen.","good":false,"why":"She said she is busy. Respect that."},{"text":"OK. I will call you some time.","good":false,"why":"\"Some time\" is not a plan."},{"text":"No problem. Is today at 6 or tomorrow at noon better?","good":true,"why":"Two choices turn \"later\" into a real time."}]},{"t":"say","icon":"⏰","h":"Keep your promise","text":"Call back at that **exact** time. Set a task in Follow Up Boss. Then you never forget."},{"t":"chat","who":"Maria","channel":"call","says":"Wait. Is this a sales call?","options":[{"text":"No. I am the agent.","good":false,"why":"Never say you are the agent. It is not true."},{"text":"I'm Ana, an assistant with Rivera Home Team. You asked about 12 Oak Street.","good":true,"why":"Honest and clear. You say who you are and why."},{"text":"No, it is only a short survey.","good":false,"why":"Never lie. One lie breaks all trust."}]},{"t":"chat","who":"Maria","channel":"call","says":"What are rates right now?","options":[{"text":"Rates are low. You should buy now.","good":false,"why":"That is loan advice. You never give it."},{"text":"Great question for your agent. Daniel can get you real numbers. Thursday at 5 or Saturday at 10?","good":true,"why":"Rates are the cost of a loan. The agent or their lender helps."}]},{"t":"sort","h":"Can you say it?","left":"OK to say","right":"Not OK","items":[{"text":"Great question for your agent.","side":"left"},{"text":"Rates will drop soon.","side":"right"},{"text":"Did you sign an agreement with them?","side":"left"},{"text":"Buy now before prices go up.","side":"right"}]},{"t":"say","icon":"✌️","h":"Two tries, then stop","text":"Use the 3 steps up to **two times** on one call. A third \"no\"? Thank them. Ask for a good day to call back."},{"t":"pick","q":"Maria says \"no\" a third time. What do you do?","options":["Try the 3 steps again, faster","Thank her and set a day to call back","Hang up without a word"],"answer":1,"why":"Respect wins. A happy lead answers your next call."},{"t":"chat","who":"David","channel":"call","says":"Stop calling me!","options":[{"text":"Can I ask just one question first?","good":false,"why":"Never argue. Stop means stop."},{"text":"I'm sorry. I will remove your number now. Have a good day.","good":true,"why":"Then tag the lead DNC. Never delete the lead."}]},{"t":"tattoo","text":"\"Stop\" is not an objection. Just stop.","sub":"Say sorry and tag the lead DNC."},{"t":"win","text":"Nice! Now you know what to say when a lead says \"no\"."}],"quiz":[{"q":"What are the 3 steps for an objection?","options":["Argue, push, close","Acknowledge, ask, appointment","Apologize, wait, hang up"],"answer":1,"explain":"Acknowledge, ask, then offer two times."},{"q":"\"I already have an agent.\" What do you ask first?","options":["Did you sign an agreement with them?","Is your agent any good?","Can you drop them?"],"answer":0,"explain":"If they signed, respect it and tell your agent."},{"q":"\"Just send me info.\" What is the best reply?","options":["Send it and end the call","Say no, a meeting is better","Say yes, then offer two times to see the home"],"answer":2,"explain":"Send the info. Ask for the appointment too."},{"q":"\"What are rates right now?\" What do you do?","options":["Tell them today's rate","Say the agent can get real numbers, then offer two times","Say rates will drop soon"],"answer":1,"explain":"You never give loan advice. The agent or their lender helps."},{"q":"\"Stop calling me!\" What do you do?","options":["Say sorry, stop and tag DNC","Ask why they are upset","Call back tomorrow to check"],"answer":0,"explain":"Stop is not an objection. Never argue."}],"mins":14},{"id":"C10","title":"Seller leads","steps":[{"t":"say","icon":"🏡","h":"Linda wants to sell","text":"Linda typed her address on a website. She wants to know her home's value. Now you call her. What do you say?"},{"t":"flip","h":"What every seller wants to know","cards":[{"front":"What is my home worth?","back":"The agent answers this. Never you."},{"front":"How fast can it sell?","back":"The agent answers this too."},{"front":"How much money do I keep?","back":"This is called the net. The agent shows it."}]},{"t":"tattoo","text":"You never give a home value.","sub":"Only the agent can. A guess hurts everyone."},{"t":"sort","h":"Can you say it?","left":"OK to say","right":"Not OK","items":[{"text":"Daniel will show you real numbers.","side":"left"},{"text":"Homes there sell for about $450,000.","side":"right"},{"text":"Can I ask why you are selling?","side":"left"},{"text":"That online price sounds right.","side":"right"},{"text":"Those websites are always wrong.","side":"right"}]},{"t":"say","icon":"🎯","h":"Your goal: a listing consultation","text":"A listing consultation is a meeting. The agent visits the home. The agent shows the seller a real price. Your job is to book it."},{"t":"pick","q":"What is your goal on a seller call?","options":["Tell them the home's value","Get them to sign papers","Book a meeting with the agent"],"answer":2,"why":"You book the listing consultation. The agent does the rest."},{"t":"flip","h":"Seller A.L.M. Same letters. Tap each one","cards":[{"front":"A","back":"Appointment: the agent visits the home."},{"front":"L","back":"Location: the home's address and a few facts."},{"front":"M","back":"Motivation: why they are selling, and by when."}]},{"t":"speak","h":"Say the opening out loud","line":"Hi Linda, this is Ana with Rivera Home Team. This call may be recorded. You asked about 418 Maple Court, right?","times":3},{"t":"order","h":"Put the seller call in order","items":["Say your name and the address","Ask why they are selling","Ask when they want to move","Offer two times with the agent"]},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"Can I ask what has you thinking about ","after":"?","options":["your loan","selling","the price"],"answer":1},{"t":"chat","who":"Linda","channel":"call","says":"My husband got a job in Phoenix.","options":[{"text":"Great! Your home will sell fast.","good":false,"why":"You cannot promise that. Ask a question."},{"text":"That is great news! When do you need to move?","good":true,"why":"Kind, and you learn her timeline."},{"text":"How much do you owe on the home?","good":false,"why":"Money questions belong to the agent."}]},{"t":"tattoo","text":"The reason sets the timeline.","sub":"Ask why they are selling. Then ask when."},{"t":"chat","who":"Robert","channel":"call","says":"Just give me a number. What is it worth?","options":[{"text":"I am an assistant. I cannot give values. Daniel can, at your home.","good":true,"why":"Honest and clear. Next, offer two times."},{"text":"Maybe $400,000 to $500,000.","good":false,"why":"A range is still a value. Never guess."}]},{"t":"chat","who":"Linda","channel":"call","says":"A website says my home is worth $520,000.","options":[{"text":"That sounds about right.","good":false,"why":"Agreeing is giving a value."},{"text":"Those sites are always wrong.","good":false,"why":"Never say bad things about the websites."},{"text":"Good starting point. A website cannot see inside your home.","good":true,"why":"True and kind. Now offer the agent's visit."}]},{"t":"speak","h":"Say it out loud","line":"Daniel can visit your home and show you real numbers. Would Tuesday at 5 or Thursday at 6 work?","times":3},{"t":"pick","q":"Linda and her husband both own the home. Who should be at the meeting?","options":["Only Linda","Both owners","Only the agent"],"answer":1,"why":"Everyone who decides should be there."},{"t":"say","icon":"🛡️","h":"Three seller objections","text":"Sellers say \"not now\" too. Use the same three steps. Acknowledge, ask, appointment."},{"t":"chat","who":"Robert","channel":"call","says":"We just want to see what we could get.","options":[{"text":"OK. Call us when you are ready.","good":false,"why":"You gave up. Always offer a time."},{"text":"Smart. Daniel can show you real numbers. Tuesday at 5 or Thursday at 6?","good":true,"why":"You agree first. Then you ask for the meeting."}]},{"t":"chat","who":"Linda","channel":"call","says":"We are not selling for six months.","options":[{"text":"Thank you. Many sellers meet the agent early. When should I check back?","good":true,"why":"You respect her date and plan a call back."},{"text":"Six months is too late. Sell now.","good":false,"why":"Never push. Respect her date."}]},{"t":"chat","who":"Robert","channel":"call","says":"What is your commission?","options":[{"text":"It is about the same everywhere.","good":false,"why":"You never talk about commission."},{"text":"Great question for your agent. Daniel will explain it when you meet.","good":true,"why":"Commission is the agent's topic."}]},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Later is a date, not a no.","sub":"Set a task. Call back when you said."},{"t":"sort","h":"Who answers it?","left":"You ask it","right":"The agent answers it","items":[{"text":"Why are you selling?","side":"left"},{"text":"What is my home worth?","side":"right"},{"text":"When do you want to move?","side":"left"},{"text":"What is the commission?","side":"right"},{"text":"How much will I keep?","side":"right"}]},{"t":"pick","q":"A buyer says: \"We must sell our house first.\" What is this?","options":["A seller lead too","A problem","A reason to end the call"],"answer":0,"why":"You found a seller. Log both needs. Tell your agent."},{"t":"win","text":"Nice work! You can now handle a seller call and book the meeting."}],"quiz":[{"q":"A seller asks: \"What is my home worth?\" What do you do?","options":["Give a price range","Say the agent will show real numbers","Read the website price"],"answer":1,"explain":"You never give a value. The agent does."},{"q":"What is the goal of a seller call?","options":["A listing consultation","A signed contract","A sale price"],"answer":0,"explain":"You book the meeting. The agent does the rest."},{"q":"In seller A.L.M., what is L?","options":["The lender","The lead's last name","The home's address"],"answer":2,"explain":"L is Location. For a seller, it is their home."},{"q":"A seller says: \"Not for six months.\" What do you do?","options":["Delete the lead","Call every day","Set a task and check back"],"answer":2,"explain":"Later is a date, not a no."},{"q":"A seller asks about commission. What do you say?","options":["It is the same everywhere","Great question for your agent. Daniel will explain it.","We can lower it"],"answer":1,"explain":"You never talk about commission."}],"mins":15},{"id":"C11","title":"Follow Up Boss and the handoff","steps":[{"t":"say","icon":"😮","h":"A great call. Then nothing.","text":"Ana books a tour. She forgets to write it down. The agent never knows. The buyer waits alone. Ouch."},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Not in Follow Up Boss? It did not happen.","sub":"Nobody heard your call. They only see your notes."},{"t":"flip","h":"Smart Lists are your to-do lists. Tap each one","cards":[{"front":"New Speed-to-Lead","back":"New leads. Call within 180 seconds."},{"front":"Hot Active","back":"Ready to buy or sell within 30 days."},{"front":"Tasks due today","back":"Calls and texts you promised for today."},{"front":"30-60 Day Nurture","back":"A month or two away. Friendly check-ins."}]},{"t":"order","h":"Put the Smart Lists in order","items":["New Speed-to-Lead","Hot Active","Tasks due today","30-60 Day Nurture"]},{"t":"pick","q":"You are calling nurture leads. A new lead arrives. What now?","options":["Finish the whole nurture list first","Call the new lead tomorrow","Finish this call, then dial the new lead"],"answer":2,"why":"New leads always come first. Dial within 180 seconds."},{"t":"say","icon":"📝","h":"The 6-part note","text":"After every talk, write a note. Always the same six parts. Then any agent can read it fast."},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each part","cards":[{"front":"Date/Time","back":"When you called or texted."},{"front":"Disposition","back":"What happened. Example: Call, connected, 4 minutes."},{"front":"A, L, M","back":"Appointment, Location, Motivation. Three parts you know!"},{"front":"Next Step","back":"What happens next, and who does it."}]},{"t":"order","h":"Put the note in order","items":["Date/Time","Disposition","A, L, M","Next Step"]},{"t":"sort","h":"Where does it go in the note?","left":"L: Location","right":"M: Motivation","items":[{"text":"Westside, 4 bedrooms","side":"left"},{"text":"Lease ends in March","side":"right"},{"text":"Up to $550,000","side":"left"},{"text":"New job, moving by May","side":"right"}]},{"t":"pick","q":"Which note is best?","options":["Tue 10:42. Call, connected. A: Sat 11. L: Mesa. M: lease ends May. Next: send invite.","Good call! Nice lady.","Wants Mesa. Send homes."],"answer":0,"why":"It has all six parts. Facts only."},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Write about the home, not the person.","sub":"Fair housing: log what they want, not who they are."},{"t":"sort","h":"Can you write it in a note?","left":"OK to write","right":"Not OK","items":[{"text":"Needs a yard for a dog","side":"left"},{"text":"Probably cannot afford it","side":"right"},{"text":"Wants one story, 3 bedrooms","side":"left"},{"text":"Older couple from another country","side":"right"},{"text":"Says pre-approved up to $480,000","side":"left"}]},{"t":"say","icon":"✅","h":"You booked it! Now three fast steps","text":"Do them before your next call. Change the stage. Send the calendar invite. Set the reminders."},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"After booking, change the stage to ","after":".","options":["Hot Active","Pending Handoff","Archived"],"answer":1},{"t":"flip","h":"What goes in the calendar invite?","cards":[{"front":"The Follow Up Boss link","back":"The agent opens the lead's story in one tap."},{"front":"Two reminders","back":"One 24 hours before. One 1 hour before."},{"front":"A buyer agreement note","back":"For tours only. It tells the agent to handle it."}]},{"t":"pick","q":"When do you put the appointment on the calendar?","options":["At the end of the shift","Before your next call","On Friday"],"answer":1,"why":"You may forget later. Do it right away."},{"t":"say","icon":"📄","h":"The buyer agreement","text":"Before a tour, the agent needs a signed buyer agreement. It is a paper between buyer and agent. The agent sends and explains it. Never you."},{"t":"chat","who":"Priya","channel":"call","says":"Do I have to sign something before the tour?","options":[{"text":"Yes. I will email it to you now.","good":false,"why":"You never send it. The agent does."},{"text":"No, do not worry about that.","good":false,"why":"Not true. The agent needs it signed."},{"text":"Great question for your agent. Daniel will explain it before the tour.","good":true,"why":"Short and true. The agent handles it."}]},{"t":"say","icon":"🤝","h":"The 3-way warm handoff","text":"Sometimes the agent is free right now. You bring the agent into the call. The lead meets the agent through you."},{"t":"order","h":"Put the handoff in order","items":["Ask the lead if the agent can join","Put the lead on a short hold","Tell the agent the lead's story","Join the calls and introduce them"]},{"t":"speak","h":"Say the handoff line out loud","line":"Daniel, I have Priya on the phone. She wants a 3-bed in Phoenix by May. Priya, meet Daniel, our local expert!","times":3},{"t":"pick","q":"The agent does not answer the handoff. What do you do?","options":["Go back and book a time with two choices","Keep the lead on hold","End the call"],"answer":0,"why":"Never leave a lead waiting. Book a time."},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Booked? Stage, invite, reminders. Right away.","sub":"Then the agent is ready and the lead shows up."},{"t":"win","text":"Great job! You can now log a call and hand off a lead."}],"quiz":[{"q":"What does every note need?","options":["Date/Time, Disposition, A, L, M, Next Step","Only the lead's name","Your feelings about the call"],"answer":0,"explain":"Six parts, every time."},{"q":"What is the stage after you book an appointment?","options":["Hot Active","Archived","Pending Handoff"],"answer":2,"explain":"Pending Handoff tells the agent a lead is ready."},{"q":"Which Smart List comes first?","options":["30-60 Day Nurture","New Speed-to-Lead","Tasks due today"],"answer":1,"explain":"New leads always come first."},{"q":"Who sends and explains the buyer agreement?","options":["You","The lead","The agent"],"answer":2,"explain":"Always the agent. Never you."},{"q":"Which reminders go with the calendar invite?","options":["24 hours and 1 hour before","One week before","No reminders"],"answer":0,"explain":"Two reminders help the lead show up."}],"mins":15},{"id":"C12","title":"Follow-up, mistakes and your numbers","steps":[{"t":"say","icon":"🌱","h":"Kevin did not answer. Five times.","text":"You called Kevin five times. No answer. On call six, he booked a tour. This happens a lot."},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Most appointments come after several tries.","sub":"So do not stop after one call."},{"t":"pick","q":"A buyer says: \"Not for six months.\" What is that?","options":["A no","An opt-out","A date"],"answer":2,"why":"They told you when. Set a task for it."},{"t":"say","icon":"🗓️","h":"Nurture","text":"Nurture means friendly follow-up over time. The sooner they plan to move, the more often you call."},{"t":"flip","h":"How often? Tap each card","cards":[{"front":"Ready in 30 days","back":"Every 1 to 3 days."},{"front":"1 to 2 months away","back":"About once a week."},{"front":"3 to 6 months away","back":"Every 2 to 3 weeks."},{"front":"6 months or more","back":"About once a month."}]},{"t":"sort","h":"Which follow-up text is better?","left":"Good text","right":"Weak text","items":[{"text":"Two new 3-bed homes came up. Want them?","side":"left"},{"text":"Just checking in!!","side":"right"},{"text":"Is spring still your plan?","side":"left"},{"text":"Are you ready to buy yet?","side":"right"}]},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"Last time you said your lease ends in March. Is that still the ","after":"?","options":["price","plan","problem"],"answer":1},{"t":"chat","who":"Kevin","channel":"call","says":"My landlord is selling. I must move in January.","options":[{"text":"That is soon! Would Saturday at 10 or Sunday at 2 work?","good":true,"why":"A closer date means ask for the appointment."},{"text":"OK. I will call you in March.","good":false,"why":"His date changed. He is ready now."}]},{"t":"pick","q":"A lead texts: \"STOP CALLING ME.\" What now?","options":["Text one more time to say sorry","Tag DNC. No more contact.","Delete the lead"],"answer":1,"why":"STOP means stop now. Never argue. Never delete."},{"t":"say","icon":"😬","h":"Oops. You made a mistake","text":"Every ISA makes mistakes. You book the wrong time. You forget a callback. What matters is the next hour."},{"t":"tattoo","text":"Tell your agent fast. Bring the fix.","sub":"A hidden mistake breaks trust. A told one builds it."},{"t":"order","h":"Put your mistake message in order","items":["Say what happened","Say what you already fixed","Say what you changed for next time","Say what you need from them"]},{"t":"sort","h":"Strong sorry or weak sorry?","left":"Strong","right":"Weak","items":[{"text":"I missed your call. I am sorry.","side":"left"},{"text":"Sorry if there was confusion.","side":"right"},{"text":"I booked the wrong time.","side":"left"},{"text":"The system did not save it.","side":"right"}]},{"t":"pick","q":"Where do you tell your agent about a mistake?","options":["In the client channel","In a private text","Nowhere. Fix it quietly."],"answer":0,"why":"Always the client channel. Your coordinator sees it too."},{"t":"chat","who":"Daniel (your agent)","channel":"text","says":"Megan booked a tour. Why did she get a \"still looking?\" text?","options":[{"text":"Sorry, the system does that sometimes.","good":false,"why":"That is an excuse. Say it was your mistake."},{"text":"My mistake. I forgot the stage. It is fixed, and I texted Megan.","good":true,"why":"You say it was you. You bring the fix."}]},{"t":"pick","q":"You texted a lead at 7 AM their time. What do you do?","options":["Call them to say sorry","Say nothing","Stop. Tell your coordinator now."],"answer":2,"why":"Rule mistakes go to your coordinator first. Never hide them."},{"t":"say","icon":"🔢","h":"Your daily numbers","text":"Three numbers show your day. Dials, talks and appointments. They are goals. Nobody expects them on day one."},{"t":"flip","h":"Tap each number","cards":[{"front":"Dials","back":"80 to 100 calls, dialed by hand."},{"front":"Talks","back":"12 to 15 real talks with leads."},{"front":"Appointments","back":"2 to 3 booked, with A.L.M."}]},{"t":"fill","h":"Finish the line","before":"A good shift has ","after":" appointments.","options":["2 to 3","10 to 12","20 to 30"],"answer":0},{"t":"pick","q":"You had many talks but no appointments. What do you fix?","options":["Dial more","Ask for a day and time on every call","Talk longer"],"answer":1,"why":"No ask, no appointment. Always offer two times."},{"t":"say","icon":"💯","h":"Your 100-point score card","text":"Your team listens to some of your calls. Each call gets a score out of 100. The goal is 90 or more."},{"t":"flip","h":"Where do the 100 points come from?","cards":[{"front":"Speed to Lead: 20","back":"Did you call within 180 seconds?"},{"front":"A.L.M. Discovery: 30","back":"Did you ask A, L and M?"},{"front":"Objections: 20","back":"Did you stay calm and ask again?"},{"front":"Notes: 15. Rules: 15.","back":"Good Follow Up Boss notes. Calling rules followed."}]},{"t":"pick","q":"Which part has the most points?","options":["Speed to Lead","Follow Up Boss notes","A.L.M. Discovery"],"answer":2,"why":"A.L.M. is 30 points. Always ask for the appointment."},{"t":"speak","h":"Say your promise out loud","line":"I call fast. I ask A, L and M. I write it down. I follow up.","times":3},{"t":"win","text":"Boot camp done! You are ready for your first real calls."}],"quiz":[{"q":"What does a great ISA do?","options":["Calls fast, asks A.L.M., writes it down, follows up","Talks as long as possible","Gives price advice"],"answer":0,"explain":"Fast, A.L.M., notes, follow-up. That is the job."},{"q":"You make a mistake. What do you do first?","options":["Hide it","Wait for the agent to find it","Tell your agent fast, with the fix"],"answer":2,"explain":"A told mistake builds trust."},{"q":"How many appointments is a good shift?","options":["2 to 3","8 to 10","20"],"answer":0,"explain":"The goal is 2 to 3 per shift."},{"q":"What score is the goal on the score card?","options":["50 or more","90 or more","70 or more"],"answer":1,"explain":"The goal is 90 out of 100."},{"q":"A lead does not answer your first call. What is true?","options":["They are not interested","You should delete the lead","Keep trying. Most appointments come after several tries."],"answer":2,"explain":"Do not stop after one call."}],"mins":16}],"sim":[{"id":"lucia","name":"Lucía Herrera","ini":"LH","color":"#9ED8B5","email":"lucia.herrera@example.com","phone":"(480) 555-2760","source":"Portal Inquiry - 3 Bed Home in Mesa","stage":"New Lead","list":"speed","listLabel":"Speed-to-Lead (0-15m)","created":"1 min ago","alm":{"a":"Not Scheduled","l":"Mesa (portal listing, 3 bed)","m":"Unknown"},"kind":"Spanish speaker","says":"Hola, sí, yo pedí información de la casa de tres recámaras en Mesa. ¿Me puede atender en español? Mi inglés no es muy bueno.","seed":[["1 min ago","system","Lead created","Portal inquiry: 3 bed home in Mesa, AZ. Form note: \"Prefiero español.\" Agreed to calls and texts. Added to the Speed-to-Lead Smart List."],["1 min ago","system","Assigned","Round-robin assigned to you (ISA)."]],"order":[1,0],"choices":[{"label":"Continue in Spanish & Run A.L.M.","text":"“¡Claro que sí, Lucía! Con mucho gusto seguimos en español. Le comento que esta llamada puede ser grabada. ¿Qué le gustó de esa casa, y busca solo en Mesa o también en otras zonas? ¿Y qué la motiva a mudarse ahora? Si le parece, nuestro agente le puede mostrar la casa este sábado a las 10 de la mañana o a las 2 de la tarde. ¿Cuál le queda mejor?”","correct":true,"pts":25,"effect":{"stage":"Pending Handoff","alm":{"a":"CONFIRMED: Saturday @ 10:00 AM w/ Agent Jordan (Spanish)","l":"Mesa or Chandler, 3 bed / 2 ba, up to $420K, big kitchen","m":"Lease ends in 60 days; current home is too small"}},"coach":"She asked for Spanish, so you stayed in Spanish: that is your advantage as a bilingual ISA. You announced the recording, asked Location and Motivation in natural Spanish, and closed with two specific times. The A.L.M. note stays in English so the agent can read it.","note":{"disp":"Call, connected (Spanish). Appointment set.","next":"Calendar invite to Agent Jordan with the Follow Up Boss link; flag that Lucía prefers Spanish and that the buyer agreement is needed before the tour. 24-hour and 1-hour reminders by text in Spanish."}},{"label":"Send Info & Hang Up","text":"“Claro, Lucía, sin problema. Le mando la información de la casa por correo y cualquier cosa usted me llama. ¡Que tenga buen día!”","correct":false,"pts":-20,"coach":"Speaking Spanish was right, but you ended a speed-to-lead call with no Location, no Motivation and no appointment ask. A Spanish-speaking buyer deserves the same full A.L.M. call as anyone else: keep going in Spanish and offer two times.","log":"Answered in Spanish but ended the call after offering to email information. No A.L.M. discovery, no appointment asked."}]},{"id":"gary","name":"Gary Whitfield","ini":"GW","color":"#F2A7A0","email":"gary.whitfield@example.com","phone":"(813) 555-6604","source":"Website Home Value Request","stage":"New Lead","list":"speed","listLabel":"Speed-to-Lead (0-15m)","created":"3 mins ago","alm":{"a":"Not Scheduled","l":"Owns 4 bed in Brandon, FL (seller)","m":"Unknown"},"kind":"Home value","says":"Yeah, I filled out that home value form. Just give me a number. What is my house worth? I am not ready to list or anything.","seed":[["3 mins ago","system","Lead created","Website home value request: 4 bed / 2 ba in Brandon, FL. Added to the Speed-to-Lead Smart List."],["3 mins ago","system","Assigned","Assigned to you (ISA)."]],"order":[0,1],"choices":[{"label":"Guess a Price Range","text":"“Sure, Gary! Homes on your street have been selling around $480K, so I would say yours is probably worth somewhere between $470K and $490K.”","correct":false,"pts":-25,"coach":"That is an opinion of value, and an unlicensed ISA never gives one. A guess also anchors the seller to a number nobody verified. Explain that a real answer needs the agent to see the home, ask what is behind the question, and offer two times for a listing consultation.","log":"Gave the seller a price range for his home (opinion of value). Out of scope."},{"label":"No Number, Set the Consultation","text":"“Great question, Gary, and it deserves a real answer, not a guess from me. Online estimates never see the inside of your home, so they can miss by a lot. Agent Jordan can walk through it and show you what it would sell for today, with no pressure to list. Can I ask what has you curious about the value right now? ... That makes sense. Would Tuesday at 5 or Thursday at 6 work for a quick walk-through?”","correct":true,"pts":25,"effect":{"stage":"Pending Handoff","alm":{"a":"CONFIRMED: Listing consultation Thu @ 6:00 PM w/ Agent Jordan","m":"Thinking of downsizing to a smaller home; maybe sell in spring"}},"coach":"You never gave a number: the value comes from your agent, at the home. You took his question seriously, found the motivation behind it, and turned it into a listing consultation with two specific times.","note":{"disp":"Call, connected. Listing consultation set.","next":"Calendar invite to Agent Jordan with the Follow Up Boss link and the property address; 24-hour and 1-hour reminders. Seller asked for no pressure to list."}}]},{"id":"jasmine","name":"Jasmine Cole","ini":"JC","color":"#C3A6F2","email":"jasmine.cole@example.com","phone":"(704) 555-3381","source":"Portal Inquiry - 2 Bed Townhome","stage":"Hot","list":"hot","listLabel":"Hot Active Leads","created":"2 days ago","alm":{"a":"Not Scheduled","l":"Charlotte / University area, townhome","m":"First-time buyer, wants to move within 30 days"},"kind":"Financing","says":"Before we go any further, what are interest rates right now? My credit score is like 640. Do you think I even qualify?","seed":[["2 days ago","system","Lead created","Portal inquiry: 2 bed townhome in Charlotte, NC. Added to the Speed-to-Lead Smart List."],["2 days ago","call","Call","Connected 3 min. First-time buyer, wants to move within 30 days. Moved to Hot Active. Callback today."]],"order":[1,0],"choices":[{"label":"No Advice, Keep A.L.M. Moving","text":"“That is such a smart question to ask early, Jasmine. I am not a lender, so I cannot speak to rates, credit or whether you qualify, and I do not want to guess about something this important. Agent Jordan works with a preferred lender and can set up that conversation if it helps. Meanwhile, are you still focused on the University area? And what is driving the 30-day timeline? Could you meet Agent Jordan Saturday at 11 or 2 to map out your plan?”","correct":true,"pts":25,"effect":{"stage":"Pending Handoff","alm":{"a":"CONFIRMED: Buyer consult Sat @ 11:00 AM w/ Agent Jordan","l":"Charlotte University area or NoDa, 2 bed townhome, up to $300K","m":"Lease ends next month; first-time buyer; asked about rates and credit"}},"coach":"You gave no rate, credit or qualification opinion. You offered the agent's preferred lender only as something the agent sets up, then went straight back to Location, Motivation and two appointment times.","note":{"disp":"Call, connected. Appointment set. Financing questions referred.","next":"Calendar invite to Agent Jordan with the Follow Up Boss link; buyer agreement before any tour; lead asked about rates and credit: Agent Jordan to decide on a lender introduction."}},{"label":"Quote Rates & Reassure","text":"“Rates are around 6.5% right now, and honestly with a 640 you should be fine for an FHA loan. Let me get you set up with our lender today.”","correct":false,"pts":-25,"coach":"You quoted a rate, gave a credit opinion and promised a loan type: all financing advice an ISA never gives. You also set up the lender yourself; the agent decides that. Say you are not a lender, mention that the agent can connect her, and keep A.L.M. moving.","log":"Quoted an interest rate and told the lead she would qualify for FHA with a 640 score. Financing advice, out of scope."}]},{"id":"brian","name":"Brian Okoye","ini":"BO","color":"#8FD3E8","email":"brian.okoye@example.com","phone":"(303) 555-9147","source":"Facebook Ad - New Construction Homes","stage":"New Lead","list":"speed","listLabel":"Speed-to-Lead (0-15m)","created":"4 mins ago","alm":{"a":"Not Scheduled","l":"Aurora, CO (new construction ad)","m":"Unknown"},"kind":"Has agent","says":"Oh, thanks for calling, but I already have an agent. We signed the buyer agreement with her last week. I just clicked on the ad out of curiosity.","seed":[["4 mins ago","system","Lead created","Facebook ad: new construction homes in Aurora, CO. Added to the Speed-to-Lead Smart List."],["4 mins ago","system","Assigned","Round-robin assigned to you (ISA)."]],"order":[0,1],"choices":[{"label":"Pitch a Second Look","text":"“Totally get it, Brian! But you can still tour these new builds with us. Our agent knows this builder really well. How about a quick look Saturday? No obligation.”","correct":false,"pts":-20,"coach":"He told you he signed an agreement with another agent. Offering a tour anyway is pitching around her agreement, which you never do. Thank him, respect it, note it, and tell your agent.","log":"Lead confirmed a signed buyer agreement with another agent; ISA pitched a tour anyway."},{"label":"Respect the Agreement","text":"“Thank you for telling me, Brian, and congratulations on getting started. I will respect that and make a note so our team does not reach out about buying. If anything ever changes, you are always welcome to call us. Have a great day!”","correct":true,"pts":20,"effect":{"stage":"Contacted","alm":{"a":"None. Respecting existing buyer agreement.","m":"Signed buyer agreement with another agent last week (per lead). Do not pitch."}},"coach":"He confirmed a signed agreement, so you respected it, ended warmly and left the door open without pitching. Log it and tell your agent the same day; the agent decides what happens to the contact.","note":{"disp":"Call, connected. Has a signed buyer agreement with another agent.","next":"Tagged Has Agent. Told Agent Jordan in the client channel; automations paused pending the agent's decision. No further outreach about buying."}}]},{"id":"dana","name":"Dana Brooks","ini":"DB","color":"#F5CF7A","email":"dana.brooks@example.com","phone":"(615) 555-4418","source":"Past Client - Purchase Closed Last Year","stage":"Warm Nurture","list":"nurture","listLabel":"30-60 Day Nurture","created":"14 months ago","alm":{"a":"None (past client)","l":"Bought 3 bed in Franklin, TN","m":"Annual check-in"},"kind":"Past client","says":"Hi! So nice of you to call. We love the house. Actually, my coworker Nina keeps asking who helped us. She wants to buy this spring, and she said I could give you her number.","seed":[["14 months ago","system","Lead created","Buyer lead from website. Closed on a 3 bed in Franklin 12 months ago with Agent Jordan."],["6 months ago","call","Call","Check-in call. Settled in, happy with the home. Next check-in in 6 months."]],"order":[1,0],"choices":[{"label":"Thank, Confirm Consent, Log","text":"“Dana, that is wonderful, thank you so much for thinking of us! Just to make sure: Nina is okay with Agent Jordan calling her? Great. What is the best number for her, and is there a time of day she prefers? I will let Jordan know the introduction came from you.”","correct":true,"pts":25,"effect":{"stage":"Warm Nurture","alm":{"m":"Happy in home. Referred coworker Nina Carter, who agreed to a call from Agent Jordan (prefers weekday evenings)."}},"coach":"You thanked her, confirmed that Nina agreed to be contacted and how she prefers it, and logged the referral on Dana's record. Nina gets a call from the agent, not a text, because she has not agreed to texts yet.","note":{"disp":"Call, connected. Past client check-in. Referral received.","a":"None (past client). Next check-in in 6 months.","next":"New lead for Nina Carter, source Past Client Referral (Dana Brooks); consent to a call confirmed through Dana; told Agent Jordan in the client channel. Thank-you note to Dana."}},{"label":"Grab the Number & Start Texting","text":"“Perfect! Send me her number and I will add her to our list and start texting her new listings today.”","correct":false,"pts":-15,"coach":"A referral is a gift, but Nina agreed only to be contacted, not to texts or a listing drip. Thank Dana first, confirm Nina is okay with a call and how she prefers it, and log the referral so the agent makes the first contact.","log":"Took the referral's number and planned to text listings without her consent to texts. Did not thank the past client or confirm consent."}]}]};
